1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,880
Borrower: a request for 5.4M USDC against Treasury notes, priced at today's US Treasury yield

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:17,200
Lender C was asked too. It seals its own quote, locking the cash

3
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,860
Its node shows one quote, its own. The rivals' quotes never reached it

4
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:26,430
Lender A, in its own session: still only its own quote

5
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:35,210
Back to the borrower: three sealed quotes, checked against the mark

6
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:40,480
It takes the cheapest quote whose haircut covers the loan

7
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:49,390
A losing lender is told its rank, and nothing else

8
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:57,530
The regulator: a best-execution record, with no lender names and no losing rates

9
00:00:57,530 --> 00:01:09,050
Every node side by side, each reading only its own ledger

